end":525,"description":"N6-methyllysine"},{"type":"Domain","start":573,"end":670,"description":"SH2"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":637,"end":637,"description":"N6-methyllysine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":657,"end":657,"description":"ADP-ribosyl glutamic acid; by PARP14"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":665,"end":665,"description":"N6-methyllysine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":701,"end":701,"description":"Phosphotyrosine; by JAK1, JAK2 or TYK2"},{"type":"Cross-link","start":703,"end":703,"description":"Glycyl lysine isopeptide (Lys-Gly) (interchain with G-Cter in SUMO1); alternate"},{"type":"Cross-link","start":703,"end":703,"description":"Glycyl lysine isopeptide (Lys-Gly) (interchain with G-Cter in SUMO2); alternate"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":705,"end":705,"description":"ADP-ribosyl glutamic acid; by PARP14"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":708,"end":708,"description":"Phosphoserine; by IKKE"},{"type":"Site","start":724,"end":724,"description":"Required for recruitment of EP300/p300"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":727,"end":727,"description":"Phosphoserine; by CaMK2, CDK8 and MAPK14"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":745,"end":745,"description":"Phosphoserine; by IKKE"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":749,"end":749,"description":"Phosphothreonine; by IKKB"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Isoform alpha homodimerizes upon IFN-gamma induced phosphorylation (PubMed:28753426, PubMed:8605877). Heterodimer with STAT2 upon IFN-alpha/beta induced phosphorylation (PubMed:8605877). The heterodimer STAT1:STAT2 forms the interferon-stimulated gene factor 3 complex (ISGF3) with IRF9 (By similarity). Interacts (phosphorylated at Ser-727) with PIAS1; the interaction results in release of STAT1 from its target gene (PubMed:17897103, PubMed:9724754). Interacts with IFNAR1; the interaction requires the phosphorylation of IFNAR1 at 'Tyr-466' (PubMed:9121453). Interacts with IFNAR2 (PubMed:9121453). Found in a complex with NMI and CREBBP/CBP (PubMed:9989503). Interacts with NMI which is required for CREBBP/CBP recruitment to the complex (PubMed:9989503). Interacts with PTK2/FAK1 (PubMed:11278462). Interacts with SRC (By similarity). Interacts with ERBB4 (phosphorylated) (PubMed:18721752). Interacts with PARP9 and DTX3L independently of IFN-beta or IFN-gamma-mediated STAT1 'Tyr-701' phosphorylation (PubMed:26479788). Interacts with histone acetyltransferase EP300/p300 in response to INF-gamma stimulation (PubMed:16257975, PubMed:26479788). Independently of its phosphorylation status, interacts with OTOP1 (By similarity). Interacts with IFNGR1 (PubMed:8156998). Interacts with STAT4 (PubMed:34508746)"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts with Sendai virus C', C, Y1 and Y2 proteins, preventing activation of ISRE and GAS promoter"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts with Nipah virus P, V and W proteins preventing activation of ISRE and GAS promoter"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts with Rabies virus phosphoprotein preventing activation of ISRE and GAS promoter"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts with HCV core protein; the interaction results in STAT1 degradation"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts with ebolavirus protein VP24"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts with Epstein-Barr virus (EBV) tegument protein BGLF2; this interaction leads to STAT1 dephosphorylation and inhibition"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts (via N-terminus) with measles V protein; this interaction inhibits STAT1 phosphorylation by Jak1 and thereby the type I interferon signaling pathway"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"P42224-2","name":"Beta","synonyms":["p84"],"notes":[],"length":712,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000392322.7","ENST00000392323.6","ENST00000673841.1","ENST00000674080.1"],"refseq":["NM_139266.3"],"refseqProteins":["NP_64467